  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced beef kidney and cook until it is browned on all sides.",
    "Add the berbere spice and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the pasta water and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the mixture for 10 minutes.",
    "Season the mixture with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the gored gored hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
